1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:01,270
Mailed cash to a

2
00:00:01,220 --> 00:00:02,230
scammer?

3
00:00:02,240 --> 00:00:03,470
You might still stop

4
00:00:03,420 --> 00:00:04,130
it.

5
00:00:04,487 --> 00:00:05,417
contact the U.S.

6
00:00:05,367 --> 00:00:06,637
Postal Inspection Service

7
00:00:06,587 --> 00:00:07,717
right away.

8
00:00:07,767 --> 00:00:13,577
The number is 1-877-876-2455.

9
00:00:13,527 --> 00:00:14,697
The FTC says that

10
00:00:14,647 --> 00:00:15,757
for a fee, they

11
00:00:15,707 --> 00:00:16,577
may be able to

12
00:00:16,527 --> 00:00:18,197
intercept a domestic package

13
00:00:18,147 --> 00:00:19,337
that hasn't been delivered

14
00:00:19,287 --> 00:00:20,077
yet.

15
00:00:20,047 --> 00:00:20,977
If you used another

16
00:00:20,927 --> 00:00:22,617
delivery company, contact

17
00:00:22,567 --> 00:00:23,617
them as soon as

18
00:00:23,567 --> 00:00:24,417
possible.

